        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/3d9bf3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-09-23T16:31:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi, I would like help&nbsp;building a villain for my far-future, inter-planetary&nbsp;RPG&nbsp;set in the Sentinel Comics universe.</p>\n<p>Detlef Gun’ter, aka <span class=\"bbcode-b\">Gauntlet</span>, is&nbsp;the most insidiuos organized crime bosses of the 30th Century whose network stretches to most of the&nbsp;higly populated worlds in the Confederation of Planets. This is in part due to many smaller crime bosses deciding it’d be best to join the&nbsp;seemingly&nbsp;immortal Detlef; a belief which has only grown after the last attempt on his life only resulted in him gaining intimidating robotic hands.</p>\n<p>I envision <span class=\"bbcode-b\">Gauntlet</span> as a prime candidate for <span class=\"bbcode-b\">Master of Behind-the-scenes</span> and so I’m trying to build him as <span class=\"bbcode-b\"> Mastermind Domain</span> villain. The <span class=\"bbcode-b\">Mastermind</span> representing him being an expert&nbsp;manipulator and schemer and&nbsp;flavouring the <span class=\"bbcode-b\">Domain</span> archetype as his agents being everywhere and him often not needing to act directly to meddle with the heroes. I am struggling to think which abilities&nbsp;from this combo to choose, which mostly is due to my inability to think of how to flavour said abilities appropriately.</p>\n<p>Do you have any ideas&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:19.386Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 3,
        "readers_count": 2,
        "score": 5.6,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 20279,
        "topic_slug": "help-me-flavour-abilities-for-a-mastermind-domain-interplanetary-mob-boss-villain",
        "display_username": "smashed247",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Hi, I would like help&nbsp;building a villain for my far-future, inter-planetary&nbsp;RPG&nbsp;set in the Sentinel Comics universe.\n\nDetlef Gun'ter, aka [b]Gauntlet[/b], is&nbsp;the most insidiuos organized crime bosses of the 30th Century whose network stretches to most of the&nbsp;higly populated worlds in the Confederation of Planets. This is in part due to many smaller crime bosses deciding it'd be best to join the&nbsp;seemingly&nbsp;immortal Detlef; a belief which has only grown after the last attempt on his life only resulted in him gaining intimidating robotic hands.\n\nI envision [b]Gauntlet[/b] as a prime candidate for [b]Master of Behind-the-scenes[/b] and so I'm trying to build him as [b] Mastermind Domain[/b] villain. The [b]Mastermind[/b] representing him being an expert&nbsp;manipulator and schemer and&nbsp;flavouring the [b]Domain[/b] archetype as his agents being everywhere and him often not needing to act directly to meddle with the heroes. I am struggling to think which abilities&nbsp;from this combo to choose, which mostly is due to my inability to think of how to flavour said abilities appropriately.\n\nDo you have any ideas&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n",
